  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "China Delayed Mode Database in China Real Time Data Base (RTDB) for NEAR-GOOS",
  "description": "China's Delayed Mode Data Base for NEAR-GOOS. Provides oceanographic data reported to the NEAR-GOOS Real-Time Data Base through the GTS (Global Telecommunication System, WMO), or directly by electronic means. The data sets are transferred on a periodic basis from the China Real-time data base. Data are available for download. First time users must register to gain database access.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: The National Marine Data and Information Service of China (NMDIS) has developed and maintained China Delayed Mode Data Base for NEAR-GOOS (CDMDB) to offer basic data service to NEAR-GOOS and GOOS communities.",
